Subject: Leave the listener close to its owner in SimpleAsync

SimpleAsync owns the listener through UniqueSocket. Closing it in runServer
causes the owner to close an invalid socket when the test returns.

--- a/test/test_epoll.cpp
+++ b/test/test_epoll.cpp
@@ -730,7 +730,6 @@
         std::cout << "serverSocket finished waiting" << std::endl;
 
         srt_close(acpsock);
-        srt_close(servsock);
     }
 
     void setup() override
